                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                        "entry_id": "3d05fb3c-5598-3ca5-9e81-08c9a01a20dd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "врач, специализирующийся на проблемах беременности и родов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ccb2d98-3dee-4c4b-9eed-fc8dec1d49f2",
                                "sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                                "text": ".. муки, предшествовавшие моему рождению, удивили матушку самым неприятным образом .. Надобно было позвать акушера, который нашёл нужным пустить кровь .. Кровь пустили, и вскоре после этого явилась на свет я .."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23045b09-e4d4-4ae5-b3d9-b8f0b43711c5",
                                "sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                                "text": "Хотя дядюшке весьма хотелось предоставить беременность графини благотворной силе природы, но, подумав немного, он признал за лучшее согласиться на желание молодых и вместо природы ввериться хорошему акушеру .."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c678f62-9664-4135-a544-8738d41a096d",
                                "sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                                "text": "Зина не могла застегнуть лифа; ходила в широких блузах, необыкновенно шедших к её высокой фигуре, и беспрестанно совещалась с докторами и акушерами. Она готовилась быть матерью .."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "25426338-766f-4e80-80a7-6aed83a2d02f",
                        "source_entry_id": "3d05fb3c-5598-3ca5-9e81-08c9a01a20dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                        "target_lang_word": "accoucheur",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "accoucheur",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a42df2a8-17b9-343c-9bee-dfbca0974fa8",
                                        "entry_id": "435b7444-eb90-3218-83c4-4eafed95cc2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person, especially a man, who delivers a baby (in childbirth)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16ca00f5-b95b-4f48-a8a8-8ba4ef6f0c84",
                                                "sense_id": "a42df2a8-17b9-343c-9bee-dfbca0974fa8",
                                                "text": "And lastly, obstetrical chairs seemed most natural to the accoucheurs of the middle ages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "271fc191-d409-4c73-9ac7-b225e2cb04eb",
                                                "sense_id": "a42df2a8-17b9-343c-9bee-dfbca0974fa8",
                                                "text": "Family story: on the day of his birth the accoucheur approached his father, the baby wrapped in a cloth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea57dcd0-dac5-46eb-9af4-d56d084b6b20",
                        "source_entry_id": "3d05fb3c-5598-3ca5-9e81-08c9a01a20dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                        "target_lang_word": "obstetrician",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "obstetrician",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9ebbb34-7d16-3a96-b661-8d90833dee1e",
                                        "entry_id": "f8724a7a-dc6c-345c-9041-faf8dd82e01b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A physician who specializes in childbirth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e4985d0-6368-4ce9-89ff-481431093ec9",
                                                "sense_id": "e9ebbb34-7d16-3a96-b661-8d90833dee1e",
                                                "text": "The preference for tightness during intercourse is so well known in Western culture that U.S. obstetricians even have a term for the extra stitch they often perform when doing episiotomy repairs following childbirth: the \"husband's stitch.\" The husband's stitch is intended to produce a smaller vaginal opening, to counteract the natural stretching of the tissues from sexual activity and childbirth and even to make the opening more constricted than it might have been before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6c84dbb-0d50-4e41-9068-b6fc69378579",
                                                "sense_id": "e9ebbb34-7d16-3a96-b661-8d90833dee1e",
                                                "text": "“Each time they’d build, they’d try to outbuild all the rest of them,” said Dr. Randall F. Hipple, a retired obstetrician who helped establish a seven-block stretch of the street as a National Historic District."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b5d9fbad-bf65-4e45-a25c-496458db7ef9",
                        "source_entry_id": "3d05fb3c-5598-3ca5-9e81-08c9a01a20dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "8f44f773-9da2-33ac-bc06-0e559c82867d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Geburtshelfer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Geburtshelfer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8824cc0c-8f47-3f49-8fe9-c78c7c4e761f",
                                        "entry_id": "ec056eb5-327f-346a-9d49-35f6d8cf818d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die eine Gebärende bei der Geburt unterstützt und den Geburtsvorgang begleitet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f220fa00-f26f-4590-9ae6-b455ead20a94",
                                                "sense_id": "8824cc0c-8f47-3f49-8fe9-c78c7c4e761f",
                                                "text": "Eine Hausgeburt sollte nur unter Aufsicht eines fachkundigen Geburtshelfers durchgeführt werden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1f0139f-3cf4-4612-9078-61d9a10a4d4f",
                                                "sense_id": "8824cc0c-8f47-3f49-8fe9-c78c7c4e761f",
                                                "text": "Bei der Geburt des Kalbes wurde der Knecht zum Geburtshelfer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93f685e6-9147-4bcd-b134-a63006cf54c5",
                                                "sense_id": "8824cc0c-8f47-3f49-8fe9-c78c7c4e761f",
                                                "text": "„Zuletzt hängt er ein Gespräch an zwischen einen erfahrnen Geburts-Helfer und einer unerfahrnen Wehmutter, worinnen der grosse Schaden, den diese ofters verursachen, angezeigt wird, welchen ein verständiger Geburts-Helfer abzuwenden fähig ist.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96a94282-3113-3af8-88b1-339f7da2e46f",
                                        "entry_id": "ec056eb5-327f-346a-9d49-35f6d8cf818d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initiator/Verursacher von etwas Neuem"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5024fc25-6f1b-44bc-a02a-b600b0c54784",
                                                "sense_id": "96a94282-3113-3af8-88b1-339f7da2e46f",
                                                "text": "„Viele Experten sehen das Alkoholverbot sogar als Geburtshelfer der organisierten Kriminalität in den USA.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
